    "detailed_description": "<strong>Fabled Frontier</strong> is an open world crafting and action rpg set in a procedurally generated world inspired by fairy tales. Build your hero as well as a home!<br><br><strong>Build your hero</strong><br>Build your hero to be a raging warrior, trap setting ranger, beast summoner, or something else!<br><br><strong>Explore the lands and beyond</strong><br>Explore the procedurally generated world and discover what creatures and lands lie in it. Then find what lies beyond the massive rings on the water. <br><br><strong>Construct a home</strong><br>Create a place to rest up and get ready for new adventures<br><br>Key Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Craft a custom character build from practically countless combinations of items, enchantments, abilities, and passive skills<br></li><li>Gather materials by engaging a wide variety of enemies<br></li><li>Visit different planes where each has various biomes to explore, creatures to fight, and resources to craft<br></li><li>Build a base</li></ul>",
